  "private": true,
  "description": "Coding agent MCP server for AIRI. Exposes workdir-scoped read/write/git tools; the agent loop itself is driven by AIRI chat orchestration.",
  "scripts": {
    "dev": "NODE_OPTIONS=--no-node-snapshot tsx src/index.ts",
